{
    "title": "Satisroom: Perfectly Organize",
    "description": "\u2728 NEW LEVELS EVERY WEEK \u2728\r\nGet ready to experience amazing new game levels coming your way this festive season! Dont miss out. Stay tuned for exciting challenges!\r\n\r\nAre you ready to leave your daily worries behind and return to the relaxing world of Satisroom - organize minigames?\r\n\r\nIn this soothing ASMR game, you can simply relax as you sort, fill, and clean, transforming chaos into a perfectly organized space.\r\n\r\nAs you organize and clean rooms, pack items, and arrange everything just so, you\u2019ll find a serene rhythm that helps melt away stress. Each minigames allow you to enjoy the simple pleasure of everything in its right place by ASMR cleaning sound and ease your OCD.\r\n\r\nFeature: \r\n- Minigames with diverse themes: makeup, cleaning, furniture arrangement, cooking, cleaning\r\n- Relaxing ASMR music and sounds, calming feeling of perfect tidy\r\n- Lovely and creative game graphics \r\n- Unlock and update levels continuously for your braintrain \r\n\r\nRelax your mind with the soothing satisfaction of organizing and cleaning. Satisroom: clear your mess, mend your soul, and calm your mind! Let's tidy!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2728 NEW LEVELS EVERY WEEK \u2728<br>Get ready to experience amazing new game levels coming your way this festive season! Dont miss out. Stay tuned for exciting challenges!<br><br>Are you ready to leave your daily worries behind and return to the relaxing world of Satisroom - organize minigames?<br><br>In this soothing ASMR game, you can simply relax as you sort, fill, and clean, transforming chaos into a perfectly organized space.<br><br>As you organize and clean rooms, pack items, and arrange everything just so, you\u2019ll find a serene rhythm that helps melt away stress. Each minigames allow you to enjoy the simple pleasure of everything in its right place by ASMR cleaning sound and ease your OCD.<br><br>Feature: <br>- Minigames with diverse themes: makeup, cleaning, furniture arrangement, cooking, cleaning<br>- Relaxing ASMR music and sounds, calming feeling of perfect tidy<br>- Lovely and creative game graphics <br>- Unlock and update levels continuously for your braintrain <br><br>Relax your mind with the soothing satisfaction of organizing and cleaning. Satisroom: clear your mess, mend your soul, and calm your mind! Let&#39;s tidy!",
